{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"0816c7eedca8e3c646439f5bef0ae2d63bbba98ce91ca8b4634f918ebee56e82"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:0565b3388d0e52d1aac0311b3e701403f9a814fd06544459250e3d27f71f7316","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Likely yes, since she has always had a strong personal drive to help others regardless of her own experiences","evidence":"[D4:15 | 10:37 am on 27 June, 2023] Caroline: Thanks, Melanie. It really mattered. My own journey and the support I got made a huge difference. Now I want to help people go through it too. I saw how counseling and support groups improved my life, so I started caring more about mental health and understanding myself. Now I'm passionate about creating a safe, inviting place for people to grow.\n[D3:5 | 7:55 pm on 9 June, 2023] Caroline: Thanks Mel! Your kind words mean a lot. Sharing our experiences isn't always easy, but I feel it's important to help promote understanding and acceptance. I've been blessed with loads of love and support throughout this journey, and I want to pass it on to others. By sharing our stories, we can build a strong, supportive community of hope.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7dea8118-acc6-5e88-b948-8c7f089a41c1","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b8af9fcc7fa6712c27ef7ecc0d689dc7c4f7f892c6957bb4938094d57e76d411","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would Caroline still want to pursue counseling as a career if she hadn't received support growing up?","referenceAnswer":"Likely no","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b8af9fcc7fa6712c27ef7ecc0d689dc7c4f7f892c6957bb4938094d57e76d411"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}